  "realization": {
    "description": "Primary use swings the pick and launches one straight bolt toward the cursor; the pick has 55% pick power. Alternate use launches one crescent toward the cursor. The crescent turns back toward you after 0.5 seconds or when it meets a wall, and expires after 3 seconds. While you hold the selected item, its ore-sense and 1 HP/s life-regeneration effects are refreshed; they can linger for up to 2 seconds after release. The two projectiles are assigned to separate inputs and do not consume the item stack.",
    "playerExperience": "The pick provides practical mining utility, while the modest bolt and somewhat stronger returning crescent offer two distinct reusable attacks. The held utility is a sustained benefit while selected, rather than a limited-use burst."
  }
